#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmcircle.xtr:50
#. i18n: /home/martin/xtrackcad/src/gtk3/app/lib/demos/dmconn1.xtr:157
#: ../../build/app/i18n/custmsg.h:272
